window.products.push({"id":1003054,"name":"Groye Cooling Shredded Memory Foam Pillow with Gel Particles [Adjustable Loft], No Smell Bed Pillow - Cover from ICY Cool Fibers, CertiPUR-US/Oeko Cer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ajOzVUZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE COMFORT! We know, you always crave the lusciousness of down pillows but also need excellent support of memory foam. Our newest bubbling technique makes the memory foam more supportive and breathable. The mix of shredded memory foam and microfiber hit the spot, which let Groye king pillows reach the perfect balance between comfort and support. The luxurious cover provides both cooling and soft touch. All details and designs of this bed pillow aim to create a great sleep you never have! ADJUSTABLE & AUTO-SHAPING! Different from traditional pillows for sleeping, this shredded memory foam pillow is moldable! With the zippered opening, you can adjust the amount of filling to get the right loft for your needs. Moreover, it comes with a smaller inner cover which can help you add the height more effectively. When you change positions, the foam pieces move with you and automatically reshape themselves to your new sleeping posture, this cooling pillow will always be just right for you! REDOUBLE COOLING & LUXURY! Groye has achieved the ultimate in its pillowcase! It is made of Icy Cool Fibers which is 0.4 on the Q-Max cooling scale. Most regular pillows are 0.2. It can absorb body heat and lower your body temperature 2-10 degrees in 5min. Groye bed pillows are equipped unique double-layer grid design with microfiber added in the interlayer, its 600 GSM which is 3 times of ordinary pillowcases(200GSM), you will enjoy the most luxurious and softest sleep with this best pillow! NO SMELL & HIGHEST QUALITY! It's one of the most healthy, odorless bed pillows you can find on the market! Groye adjustable pillow is CertiPUR-US certified and OEKO approved, which means it adheres to stringent safety standards and no chemicals are used in its production. We also add cooling gel particles, making this breathable side sleeper pillow more ultra-cooling! What's more, our newest technique and exclusive formula make my pillow more outstanding - durable and more supportive. 100-NIGHT SLEEP TRIAL & Risk-Free! If you believe tossing and turning at night is a fact of life, it’s time to remind yourself how great sleep can be! This home goods pillow is suitable for all types of sleepers including side, back and stomach sleepers! We provide a 100-nigh trial which is long enough for you to make sure it’s the right choice. If this coop pillow doesn't meet your expectation, we promise a refund or replacement - no questions asked! ALL COSTS ARE ON US!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ajOzVUZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Groye","source_asin":"B0C4GKNG9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GKNG9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GKNG9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
