window.products.push({"id":1003072,"name":"ROOMTEC 36 x 28 Inches LED Bathroom Mirror with Front and Backlit,Anti-Fog,3 Colors and Dimmable Light(Horizontal/Vertical)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":162.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613ei+u7LkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Glass and Aluminium 【3 Color Frontlit & Backlit】: ROOMTEC's LED bathroom mirror provides brighter and softer frontlit and backlit lighting with adjustable brightness and color temperature. 【Anti-fog】The defogger can be separately control.It can be fast heating defogging and 1 hour safe automatic shutting down.Turn on before bath always kept the fog away. 【Smart Memory Function】: With three color warm (3000K), natural (4000K), and white (6000K)temperature options and adjustable brightness, The brightness memory function allows you to recall the last light temperature and brightness setting when turning on the switch. 【Long Lifetime】: Built-in 240 lamp beads per meter and has a long lifespan of over 30,000 hours 【Easy to Install】The LED mirror supports with both vertical and horizontal installation. Moreover, the wall-mounted lighted mirror can be installed with wall switch or hardwired as you prefer. 【Shatter-proof】: Made from strong glass and with an epoxy coating, this mirror is shatterproof and corrosion-resistant, making it more durable and safer to use. 【ETL Certification 】 This product is ETL certified, conforming to U.S. producing safety standard. the plug conforms to the USA UL certification 💙Tips: If you want to turned off the blue lights of the controls, Just 3 seconds - press the button to turn off","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613ei+u7LkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROOMTEC","source_asin":"B0BRXR393V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXR393V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXR393V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
