window.products.push({"id":1003119,"name":"MOSADE Artificial Areca Palm Tree 5Feet Fake Tropical Palm Plant and Handmade Seagrass Basket, Perfect Tall Faux Dypsis Lutescens Plants for Entryway ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EDJ6Lvy2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifelike Design & Exquisite Details – Our artificial palm tree in pot is designed with lush branches and leaves that mimic the real tree thanks to the lifelike details and natural shapes. you can hardly tell it from a real one when looking from short distance. Perfect for indoor decoration. Selected material,Built to last,Free detachable – Approx 5 Feet tall with black pot (6\" Diameter * 5\" Height),branch can free detachable,easy to assembly,real touch, that’s not easy to deform and can withstand aging, the leaves are made of artificial silk fabric which is durable and easy to wipe clean, so the tall fake plant can bring elegance and romance to the room for years to come. When you don't need it, you can accommodate it into the carton and don't take your space. Include multipurpose basket – Not only use as a basic planter cover but also use it for various purposes; Great for storage bins for clothes, blanket, baby toys, home supplies, picnic, grocery baskets, beach bag. Widely used it in the living room, bedroom, restroom, nursery or a laundry room Perfect decoration for indoor&sheltered outdoor – No watering, no pruning, no fertilizer required, the faux plants tall is an ideal room decoration for people who love plant but don’t have the time or energy to care for a real one.Perfect for home, living room, reading room, office, shop, entryway, hallway, bedroom, classroom, shopping mall and many commercial places. Your Satisfaction Comes First – MOSADE is a company with years of expertise designing, developing, and manufacturing high-quality indoor and outdoor decorative artificial plants. Contact us if you have any questions. We'll be happy to assist you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EDJ6Lvy2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSADE","source_asin":"B0B711VY9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B711VY9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B711VY9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
