window.products.push({"id":1003124,"name":"GUANENA 12 Pack 16oz Clear Glass Bottles with Cork Lids and PVC Shrink Capsules, 500 ml Empty Home Brewing Wine Bottles with Funnel for Sparkling Wine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j-FvGcAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 12 Bottles: Each bottle is equipped with a cork lid and PVC heat shrink capsule, can hold up to 16 oz (500ml) liquid. Comes with a high-quality funnel to ensure easy pouring without any waste. Ideal for fermentation and home brewing! High Quality & Elegant Design: Made of heavy duty food-grade glass, BPA free and lead free, reliable and durable. With a straight and tall slim design, this bottle is easier to hold than normal wine bottle. The classic and beautiful looking also makes it great as a gift. Double Sealing: Each bottle has a T-shaped stopper which fits the opening tightly to ensure good air tightness in the bottle. And PVC shrink capsule provides wine bottle a sophisticated look and ensure integrity, double protection to keep the drinks safe and fresh. Multiple Uses: Excellent for wine making, home brewing kombucha, limoncello, kefir, beer, soda, homemade beverages, iced tea, juice, sauces and more. And the bottle can be made into crafts with lights, flowers and other accessories. You can make them as harmonious and high level scenes in home, garden, party, wedding, bar, restaurant and anywhere you want. Warm Notice: Each set has 12 empty bottles with cork lids and PVC heat shrink capsules, bonus 1 funnel. We focus on every detail of our products and safe packaging, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j-FvGcAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUANENA","source_asin":"B09P165V9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P165V9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P165V9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
