window.products.push({"id":1003181,"name":"HULISEN 3 Tier Hanging Fruit Basket with Banana Hook, Heavy Duty Wire Hanging Baskets for Kitchen Storage, 36 Inch Hanging Vegetable Produce Basket Or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XJ4+3PzML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy Duty Wire Kitchen Basket: Vertical installation, better control of the height of the metal fruits basket. Round metal piece added to the bottom of the hanging basket to effectively prevent small fruits from falling. Elegant and minimalist design that is both functional and decorative. Three tiered hanging fruit basket can change the overall look of kitchen, especially small ones where storage and counter space is limited. Removable Banana Hook: With a banana hook, it is a great addition to the hanging fruit baskets for kitchen, and it can be used by placing it in the hole at the bottom of the black wire basket. Allow your bananas to ripen naturally after hanging without being mushy or bruised. Get better taste and freshness. Easy No-tool Assemble: Overall height of fruit hanging basket is 36\", and the diameter of each basket is 11.3\", 9\", 7\". Three mounting clips on each level can be easily linked and adjusted to hold items of different heights, or removed to use separately. Fruit basket hanging make it a pleasure to organize and display fruits in the kitchen, easy organization of fruits and vegetables. Free up Counter Space: The elegant 3-tier design of the hanging kitchen baskets provides ample storage space, perfect for freeing up fridge space or preventing countertop clutter. Hanging produce basket is not only can hold apples, oranges, mangoes, potatoes, onions, but also snacks, baked cookies, chocolate, chips, etc. Beautiful and Strong: Made of sturdy iron with black coating, modern elegance, durable and not easy to deform. Equipped with black hanging bracket and screws, hanging vegetable baskets for kitchen is easy to assemble and can be used stably for a long time. The circular coils are spaced, open concept for ample air circulation, ideal for storing fruits and veggies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XJ4+3PzML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HULISEN","source_asin":"B0C4XKW98N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4XKW98N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4XKW98N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
