window.products.push({"id":1003305,"name":"OCTROT Electric Heated Blanket Throw, 5min Fast Heating Blanket with 10 Heat Level & 5 Timer Options Auto Shutoff, Sherpa & Flannel Heated Blankets La","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AP+Z4lUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SAFE IS THE RULE NO.1]The essence of a electric blanket throw is to ensure the chance of fire hazard is 0. But how we keep the wonderful thing: 1🥳, 5 timer auto-off options to prevent overheating and short circuit proved by ETL and FCC certification. 2🥳, Sensitive AI control inside grabs ambient minutely to ensure a matched heating process, any chances of short circuit were destroyed. 3🥳, : Automatic error reporting is another game changer which is the third security line. [WARM & SAVE ON ELECTRIC BILLS] Electric heated blankets works like pouring toasty warm into your body. 🤩 10 heating levels(L-2-3-4-5-6-7-8-9-H / 59℉-131℉) & fast heating in 5 min: adjust the electric throw blanket to your favorite temperature in 5 min. All models have built-in continuous sensing technology to adjust the temperature to be maintained at the heating level you have set before, which actually add up to big savings on electric bills but offer 31% larger than those ordinary blankets. [SOFT LIKE BABY RABBITS] Gotta love the luxurious material: It’s a soft sherpa electric throw one side and a silky flannel heat blanket another side. 🌞 Upgraded 440GSM helps maintain the toasty warm. 😻 Our heated throw blanket electric features soft material like baby rabbits, only cuter with buffalo plaid print plus three press buttons to kill all the irritating slide-off-your-back situation. Good heated blankets make you would never put up with bundling up on the couch anymore. [VERSATILE BLANKET] Imagine you are snuggling on the couch at movie nights, a heating blanket throw electric definitely beats bundling up. Heat blankets electric could also be an office blanket: Arrive at work and notice you could show off your new top without being freezing. Softheat electric blanket could just be normal sherpa blankets: unplug the heated throw and take it anywhere, extra buttons design to ensure you are wearing a stylish poncho without notice. Sure be gifts for any occasions. [TIPS ON INCREASING THE DURABILITY] DO NOT plug the main power cord into the wall outlet until you have connect the cord to the module. 🎯 Always connect the cord to the module first 🎯. Similarly, to disconnect the controller, firstly unplug the power cord from the wall outlet. 5-year-warranty is for sure, we provide you 24-hour response guarantee: feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AP+Z4lUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCTROT","source_asin":"B09C3NL81D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C3NL81D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C3NL81D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
