window.products.push({"id":1003315,"name":"Trudeau Oven Glove 1 Piece, one size, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rFa5z914L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Trudeau Corporation we are proud to be recognized as a leader in the design and development of kitchenware and housewares products. Since 1889, four successive generations have managed Trudeau Corporation, instilling the values of family and tradition into our corporate culture. We owe our success to the efforts of an experienced and dedicated team, to the creative input of talented design partners and to the expertise of our carefully chosen manufacturers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rFa5z914L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B00GMPVH54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GMPVH54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GMPVH54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003316,"name":"Dash Dash DPBD002BU Personal Blender with BPA Free Tumbler + Carry Loop for Flavored Water, Protein Shakes, Smoothies, 20 oz, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jWP+G9J2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take your smoothies and protein shakes to go with the colorful Dash Go Sport Blender. Quickly and easily make a healthy, portion-controlled drink in the included BPA-free Tritan portable blending bottle. The convenient travel lid lets you drink it on the run or store it in the fridge for later. Delicious recipes included in manual and gain access to our online growing database of recipes! .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jWP+G9J2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DASH","source_asin":"B01IJM8CDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IJM8CDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IJM8CDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003317,"name":"Wine Glass Cover (Z6) with MIXED charms. Made in the USA (6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LhAR4i7zL._AC_.jpg","description":"The A-shape (conical) was created to protect one's drink when the owner is not around. With time, however, we found out that out customers would like to be able to move around with their drink protected by a Topper and hence the Z-shape (called that after its zig-zagish cross-cut) was born. Elegant dining table accessory made of high-quality stainless-steel mesh. Ideal for outdoor dining, weddings, corporate events, camping. We created GlassTopper for a very simple purpose: to protect wine, beer, cider (or any other drink) glasses everywhere from pesky, unwelcomed \"visitors.\" We believe that there is no place inside your drinking glass for any crawling or flying creatures, no matter how small or cute (although usually they are neither). Nothing spoils a glass of a good Pinot Noir or Chardonnay like a fly taking a swim in what you were about to enjoy! As part of our effort to develop a product that could be used as an elegant dining-table accessory, our Toppers fit containers of various lip sizes. It was also important to us that the product is easy to store and is made of highest-quality materials. What's more, we strongly believe that American companies should manufacture their products nationally and thus contribute to the growth of our great nation. Our Toppers are proudly made and electropolished in the U.S.A. We hope that you will enjoy the Toppers and that they will become a regular accessory on your outdoor table! (Btw, it is also an awesome and very unique gift!). Toppers come with an attractive pendant. Availability and choices of pendants change throughout the year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LhAR4i7zL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GlassTopper Bug Stopper (TM)","source_asin":"B01HQR53BK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HQR53BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HQR53BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003318,"name":"Cuisinart DLC-2APF 3-Cup Mini-Prep Plus Food Processor, Passion Flower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613oBsNGhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Included components of the Cuisinart Mini-Prep Plus Processor Pulse controlled buttons Why Is This The Perfect Mini Processor For You? The Cuisinart Mini-Prep Plus Processor handles a variety of food preparation tasks including chopping, grinding, puréeing, emulsifying and blending. The patented auto-reversing SmartPower blade provides a super-sharp edge for the delicate chopping of herbs and for blending and puréeing other soft foods. The blunt edge offers a powerful cutting surface to grind through spices and other hard foods. Pulse activation gives maximum control for precision processing, whether chopping or grinding. Spatula, product manual and recipe booklet included. Using Your Cuisinart Mini-Prep Plus Processor The powerful high-speed 250-Watt motor works hard and fast to accomplish any small job with ease. Chop herbs, onions, garlic; grind spices, hard cheese, purée baby foods; blend mayonnaise and flavored butters, all with the same compact appliance. The Mini-Prep Plus Processor takes up minimum counter space and stores neatly on the countertop or in a cabinet. Best Practices When Using Your Cuisinart Mini-Prep Plus Processor Size Always cut large pieces of food into smaller pieces of even size – about 1/2-Inch. If you don't start with pieces that are small and uniform, you will not get an even chop. Quantity You don’t want to overload the 3-Cup work bowl. Use the quantities given in the included recipe section of the product manual. As a rule of thumb, remember that after being processed, food should not reach more than 2/3 of the way up the central hub of the blade assembly. Selecting the Right Operating Control Use the Chop function for chopping, puréeing and mixing. It’s the best option, for example, when chopping soft, fragile food such as herbs, celery, onions, garlic and most cheeses. It is also the right choice for puréeing cooked vegetables, making mayonnaise and mixing salad dressing. Pulse action is best when you are using the chop function. Two or three pulses are often enough. Use the Grind function for grinding spices, and for chopping hard food such as peppercorns, seeds, chocolate and nuts. Continuous-hold action is best when you are using the grind function. Adding Liquid You can add liquids such as water, oil or flavoring while the machine is running. For example, you might want to add oil when making mayonnaise or salad dressing, or you could add vanilla or alcohol when making frozen yogurt. Pour the liquid through one of the two openings in the cover. Removing Food From the Sides of the Bowl Occasionally food will stick to the sides of the bowl as you process. Stop the machine to clear food away. After the blade has stopped moving, remove the cover, and use the spatula to scrape the food from the sides of the bowl back into the center. Cleaning and Storage Read to clean up? No problem! To simplify cleaning, rinse the work bowl, cover, and blade immediately after each use, so that food won’t dry on them. Wash blade assembly, work bowl, cover, and spatula in warm soapy water. If you have a dishwasher, you can wash the work bowl, cover, blade assembly, and spatula on the top rack. The Mini-Prep Plus Processor stores neatly on the countertop in a minimum of space. The hidden cord storage underneath the motor base will help to keep excess cord off the countertop. Store the unit assembled to prevent loss of parts. Easily dice tomatoes in seconds! Just a Few of the Many Foods You Can Prepare Food Item Operation/Technique Comments/Notes Seeds and Dried Berries Grind. Pulse to break up, then process continuously to desired consistency. Coriander, cumin, dill, fennel, sesame, poppy, and juniper berries Herbs, fresh Chop. Pulse to chop to desired consistency. Rinse and dry completely. Remove leaves from stems to chop. Onions Chop. Pulse 5-10 times to chop to desired size. Peel; Cut into 3⁄4-inch or smaller pieces of similar size. Mushrooms Chop. Pulse to chop to desired consistency. Choose firm, fresh mushrooms. Cut into quarters or even-size pieces, no larger than 3⁄4-inch. Nuts Chop. Pulse to chop to desired consistency. Toast nuts first for maximum flavor. Allow to cool completely before chopping. Vegetables, cooked Chop. Pulse 5-10 times to chop, then process continuously until desired consistency is reached. Cook vegetables until tender. Process to a smooth purée for baby food or sauces; may need to add liquid for consistency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613oBsNGhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B00ARRGG5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ARRGG5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ARRGG5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
