window.products.push({"id":1003459,"name":"Selamica Ceramic Japanese Ramen Noodle Soup Bowl, 40 Ounce Large Serving Bowls with Matching Spoon and Chopsticks for Udon Soba Pho Asian Noodles, 2 S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zM2nYuBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TRADITIONAL AUTHENTIC STYLE: Authentic Japanese-style ramen bowl. Our noodle bowls are made to last daily use, hand-crafted from thick, durable, and restaurant-grade ceramic material. GREAT SIZE - 40oz ramen bowls with 8inches diameter. Enough volume so that the soup does not overflow, the large diameter can make the ingredients perfectly appear in front of you and evoke your appetite. Great for Ramen, noodles, Pho, Udon, Salad, Soba, Rice, Pie, cereals, popcorn, oatmeal or any Soup meals. EASY CLEANING: The surface of the bowls is smooth due to the perfect glazed coating, which makes them quite easy to clean and fit well in your dishwasher. PRO-GRADE CERAMIC BOWLS - These ramen bowls are made of durable ceramic, LEAD-FREE and NON-TOXIC, chip-resistant. Microwave, oven, dishwasher, and freezer safe. A ceramic ramen bowl keeps your ramen hot for a longer period of time than its melamine or plastic counterpart. SPOON AND CHOPSTICKS INCLUDED: Each set comes with everything you need. Great tableware to serve your family and guests with. With these beautiful bowls and chopsticks, your home cooked meals can feel like you are eating out at a fancy restaurant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zM2nYuBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Selamica","source_asin":"B093T2X8H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093T2X8H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093T2X8H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003460,"name":"AREKER 30 LEDs 3 Star Window Lights, Battery Hanging Valentines Day Decor with 8 Flashing Modes and Memory Function Star Valentines Decorations Indoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EzQgMX6QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐【2023 Upgrade Model】The upgrade star lights have 8 flash modes, choose the mode to suit your mood and favorite scenes. Moreover, The star lights come with a memory function so that when the lights come back on, they will be in the same mode as when they were turned off. The timer function(6 hours on/18 hours off) will automatically turn on when you turn on the star lights, it will greatly extend the life of the battery and save you a lot of money on electricity. (Timer mode can't be turned off) ⭐【Lovely and Creative】 Areker 3-Star window lights: every crystal and clear star is wrapped in 10 warm white LEDs, and 3 stars are wrapped in 30 warm white LEDs. Each light looks like a tiny star, creating an excellent twinkling effect. You will enjoy the beautiful sea of stars at home. The lead length is 3.3ft, the diameter of the star is 0.6ft, and 3 stars go through a 2ft cable, connecting and hanging down in different lengths: 2ft, 1.3ft, and 1.7ft. ⭐【Easy to install—Won’t fall down】 Our Valentine star decorations come with 4 super-sticky non-marking sticker hooks, which can be easily installed on windows, doors, cabinets, etc. The height can be adjusted to any fixed position, creating a beautiful shape. By using the non-marking sticker hook, you can install the fairy light without drilling holes in the wall, perfectly protecting your wall from damage. Tips: Please use non-marking stickers on a clean and seamless surface. ⭐【Safety and Durable】 Our UL588-certified valentines indoor window lights use high-quality PS materials. Each star contains 10 warm white LEDs (3 of the stars contain 30 LEDs), powered by 3 AA batteries (not included), which can be used continuously for more than 90 hours—No-Glare, Low-Heat, and Touch-safe. You and your family will be able to safely decorate with valentines stars and lights, and experience a pleasant and warm atmosphere together. ⭐【Multi-occasion decorating】With IP44 Waterproof rating(even the battery box)Areker valentines day star decor is suitable for outdoor use. No worries about rain and snow. It’s great for valentines, Christmas, birthday parties and other festivals, it is also amazing for daily use. Decorate with them, any way you like: hang them on a bedroom wall, windows, doors, cabinets, trees, balconies, courtyards, or anywhere you want! Areker valentines decor give you a glowing warm atmosphere, year-round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EzQgMX6QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Areker","source_asin":"B0BC7YKFRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC7YKFRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC7YKFRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
