window.products.push({"id":1003463,"name":"Mesh Shower Caddy Basket with 8 Storage Pockets, Portable Shower Tote Bag Hanging Swimming Pool, Toiletry Bathroom Organizer for College Dorm Room Ess","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMQF3omnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity Shower Basket】 The shower caddy portable has 8 outer compartments and a large one in the center, which is enough to hold all your toiletries, such as shampoo, conditioner, cosmetics, soap, razors, toothbrush, comb, etc. The shower caddy dorm makes all of your bathroom accessories organized and shipshape, within easy reach and saving space. 【Sturdy Shower Caddy Bag】 The polyester mesh shower tote is made of tough and high-quality mesh material. Rubbery breathable mesh fabric dries quickly, double reinforced oxford cloth handles hanging heavy items without tearing. The black shower caddy with steady construction and properly sewn can last for a long time. 【Hanging ＆ Quick-Drying Design】 The shower caddy college is also equipped with 2 handles which make it can be suspended rather than touching the ground. Breathable mesh allows the travel shower caddy to drain out any remaining water, so it dries quickly. All you have to do is hang the mesh shower bag on the door, shower, or hook and wait for it to dry. 【Portable Bathroom Tote】 This bathroom caddy is compact, lightweight, durable, stylish, and easy to carry. You can carry it anywhere with the easy handle, hanging gym shower caddy over the door, showerhead, or put the gym shower bag on a shower stand in the corner. The bathroom caddy organizer can also be folded up when it is empty. 【Widely Used Bath Bag】With the large shower caddy, no need to complain about communal showers or accidentally leaving items in the bathroom. The camping shower caddy makes carrying items and keeps the shower tidy easily. Perfect shower tote dorm caddy for the college dorm, camping, travel, gym, swimming, beach, picnic. Or use it as a diaper bag, bath toy net, and storage organizer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMQF3omnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hommtina","source_asin":"B091GS9R17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GS9R17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GS9R17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
