window.products.push({"id":1003469,"name":"Churchill China Thanksgiving Full Color Turkey Creamer and Covered Sugar Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KJCHZABWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Thanksgiving Turkey Multi Coloured dinnerware is produced by utilising the centuries old art of transfer printing from an original engravings which bring to life the Turkey which we all associate with the traditional Thanksgiving Holiday. We at Churchill try to bring the best out in our designs by reproducing our ceramics the way our forefathers did in the 18th Century. Each Piece is processed and handled at least 50 times before it is finally made ready for our customers. This vintage feel is applied to the pair of Creamer & Covered Sugar Bowl, perfect for either Casual or Formal Dining. Manufactured in fine English Earthenware, Thanksgiving Turkey products are both Microwave & Dishwasher safe. This collection is endorsed by Churchill China with its 200 years of history in the manufacture of dinnerware for the home. Amazon.com Churchill, a British producer of tableware for more than 200 years, has thoughtfully created a pattern specifically for the celebration of the most food-focused of American family holidays--Thanksgiving--with a design transfer-printed from an early American copperplate engraving. The Thanksgiving Turkey creamer and sugar bowl are meant to be integrated with other matching pieces into a festive Thanksgiving table display. They're perfect companion pieces for the matching teapot; the handles on the creamer and sugar bowl lid echo the tea pot's lid and handle in miniature. The turkey featured in the Churchill Thanksgiving Turkey design is highly detailed, as if from an antique natural history engraving; the bird stands in full-tailed display amid a cluster of ferns on two sides of the creamer. The upper rims of both pieces, as well as the sugar bowl lid, feature equally detailed drawings of forest flora: blackberries, acorns, oak leaves, and simple wild rose blossoms. The color palette includes soft blues, reds, golds, and greens in the muted tones of a hand-tinted photograph. The Churchill Thanksgiving Turkey pattern offers a wide range of matching pieces such as basic 5-piece place settings, napkin rings, a soup tureen, a cookie jar, and a 6-cup teapot, as well as other individual setting pieces. Churchill earthenware is safe for use in the microwave and freezer; however, avoid rapid temperature changes by allowing dishes to make gradual transitions. Churchill pieces are also dishwasher safe; when hand washing, avoid abrasive cleansers and scourers. The Churchill Thanksgiving Turkey 8-ounce creamer measures 4-3/4 by 3-1/4 by 3-3/4 inches; the matching 6-ounce sugar bowl has a 4-inch diameter and stands 4 inches tall when the lid is on. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KJCHZABWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Churchill China","source_asin":"B0002EXGRI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002EXGRI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002EXGRI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003470,"name":"TOPJUM Space Saver Storage Bags for Clothes No Vacuum or Pump Needed Travel Vacuum Roll-Up Reusable Storage Bags Perfect Packing Organizers (8pcs) (8,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXo9CKKrL._AC_SL1210_.jpg","description":"Packing can be a disturbing chore, especially when you manage to pack a lot of clothes in a small luggage or storage box. Now TOPJUM gives you a quick and easy storage solution with our brand new space saver storage bags. It saves a lot of space, and increases the packing capacity by three times. Simply pack, zip and roll, no pump is required, the valve at the end of the bag compresses the air efficiently and tightly. The vacuum storage bag set eliminates your packing hassles and makes traveling and storage easier! Your personal belongings will be safe from mold, dust, mildew, dirt, bugs, and bacteria. Maintain fresh and clean clothes and linens throughout your travels with TOPJUM travel storage bags! Package Include: 5 x Medium size vacuum roll-up storage bags (24inch x 16inch) 3 x Small size vacuum roll-up storage bags (20inch x 16inch) Item Specifics: Material: PET+PE  Color: Navy Blue Method of Use: 1. Arrange items  Put items in the bag, do not overfill bag; 2. Close the zipper  Press the slider and move it slowly from one end to the other to seal the bag; 3. Remove Air Roll up or compress the bags to squeezing air out Tips: ● Storage suggestions for storage bags in different sizes:  - 60cm * 40cm : Suitable for storing 2-3 coats or 2 sweaters; - 50cm *40cm : Underwear or other travelling goods.  ● Fold clothes as neatly and as flat as possible in order to minimise wrinkling; ● Avoid storing bags near sharp objects or heat sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXo9CKKrL._AC_SL1210_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPJUM","source_asin":"B078SSFMNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SSFMNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SSFMNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
