window.products.push({"id":1003517,"name":"Kuchenprofi 14-Ounce Stainless Steel Shaking Sieve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l2YnmU+UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Founded in Solingen Germany by Artur Schmitz in 1923, the story of Kuchenprofi is one of diligence, innovation and refinement. Early on, Kuchenprofi realized the need for affordable functional tools that make the kitchen more efficient and more enjoyable. The name of Kuchenprofi reflects strength, quality and functionality demanded by chefs around the world. Kuchenprofi made for professionals, now available to anyone passionate about cooking. For lump-less gravy, velvety-smooth sauces and sky-high cakes, sift your flour in Kuchenprofi's Shaking Sieve. Above the fine mesh screen is a rotating paddle that spins back and forth when you squeeze the handle. No cumbersome cranks, no sore wrists. Crafted of premium quality stainless steel that will keeps its gleaming good looks for years of service. Dishwasher safe. 14 oz. capacity. 3-3/4-inch H by 6-1/4-inch W by 4-1/4-inch D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l2YnmU+UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchenprofi","source_asin":"B004AP9GGU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004AP9GGU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004AP9GGU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
