window.products.push({"id":1003632,"name":"Coavas Window Privacy Film Non-Adhesive Frosted Glass Static Cling Sun Blocking Heat Control Home Office Decorative Stickers for Bathroom Door Coverin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812pThX7W2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coavas Home Office Privacy Window Film --The second ALDI: Our commitment to bringing you the lowest possible prices on a wide range of home office products， there’s nothing like shopping at COAVAS Home Decor & Furniture store! Coavas Home Office Privacy Window Film -- GLARE CONTROL & UV REJECTION-- Heat insulation in the summer and heat preservation in the winter. Blocks moderate glares and 96% harmful UV rays, prevent fading furniture and allow soft light for you room. Coavas Home Office Privacy Window Film --- REUSABLE & RECYCLED-- No adhesive, removable without any residue, super static cling, easy to apply and can be applied several times. Water is the only tool you will use, more water is better. Size: 45*200 cm ( 17.5 x 78.7 inch) Coavas Home Office Privacy Window Film -- ECONOMICAL & WIDE APPLICATION-- No more heavy & troublesome curtains or blinds, simple decorations make the life easier and better. smooth and clean Glass Surfaces in the Bathroom, Balcony, Living Room, Bedroom, Bathroom, Office, hotel, etc. Frosted glass, cut glass and all of processed glass is not workable. Coavas Home Office Privacy Window Film -- INSTALLATION TIPS-- Clean windows or glass; Measure, mark and cut the film; Wet the window, more water more better; Peel off the backing film; Squeeze out excess water and bubbles with scraper or hard card; Dry off your window with the rag. (Make sure the edge of the protective film and the glass surface have a 1cm gap. )if it is difficult to tear off the protective film, you can try to tape the two sides with duct tape and then peel off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812pThX7W2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coavas","source_asin":"B08P4VFD63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4VFD63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4VFD63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003633,"name":"Madison Park Montauk 8 Piece Comforter Set Blue Full/Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xDt4klwNL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For a calming beach feeling to your bedroom, the Montauk Comforter set provides cool colors and a beautiful paisley design. The cotton comforter and shams have a solid brushed polyester reverse and feature solid blue piping creating a flange look to the edges. Two decorative pillows with pleat and euro shams with a 2\" flange complete this look. Comf and sham face: 100% cotton 180TC printing back: micro fiber 75gsm; Filling: 250gsm poly fill; Bedskirt drop: 100% cotton 180TC, platform: polyester; Pillow: cotton cover with poly fill; Euro sham face: 100% cotton 180TC back: micro fiber.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xDt4klwNL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B00J64IOWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J64IOWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J64IOWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003634,"name":"Ideal Home Range Cocktail Decorative Paper Napkins, Curly Girl Design Tiny Magic, 20 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EjpQV5hQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Leigh Standley's popular greeting cards have been transformed into a line of delightful cocktail napkins. Inspirational and fun, they capture the spirit of the season in a unique and amusing way. It was the love and appreciation of fine design along with the opportunity to create and market well-made yet affordable products that lead Jonathan Newman and Steven Faulkner to find Boston International (BI) in 1986. In the beginning, BI was a boutique line with beautiful hand-made paper products from smaller suppliers in Italy, Spain, Germany and the UK. Through the years the company developed and grew; in 1996 Boston International added Ideal Home Range (IHR) to their product mix and very shortly after that BI began its relationship with New York's Metropolitan Museum of Art. Through the combination of these lines, BI's core group of suppliers and BI's development of proprietary lines and accessories, BI has created a major force in the gift industry today. Currently BI partners with suppliers and manufacturers from around the globe to bring their vision to the US market. BI now employs more than 50 people in rustic Holliston, Massachusetts, some 25 miles west of Boston. Boston International's philosophy is the same now as it was back in 1986, combine the very best design with the highest quality materials and manufacturing, then add outstanding distribution and unmatched customer service. Currently over 19,000 customers in 11 countries are the beneficiaries of this philosophy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EjpQV5hQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ideal Home Range","source_asin":"B008S0V42C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008S0V42C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008S0V42C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1003635,"name":"Contour Products Kneezup Leg Wedge Cushion","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GjxGSCeCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kneezup Leg Wedge Cushion relaxes tired legs, soothe achy knees and comforts your lower back. Place the wedge under your knees and they are instantly elevated to a 30 degree angle so joints and muscles can relax, rest and rejuvenate. The special design increases blood floor to lower extremities and eases with conditions like lower back pain and varicose veins. Constructed of medical grade foam, the wedge provides optimal support over time. The machine washable cover is made of a premium velour material for your utmost comfort. Since the introduction of our first product in 1991, Contour Products has emerged as a recognized leader of specialty sleep, comfort and support solutions. Our products help to properly align the body for overall comfort and improved well-being.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GjxGSCeCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Contour","source_asin":"B0036ZHIW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0036ZHIW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0036ZHIW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
