window.products.push({"id":1003689,"name":"Malden International Designs My First Years Beaded Two Tone Silver Metal Picture Frame, 3 Option, 1-3.5x4 & 12-1x1, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OMp3tm3VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is astonishing how much a baby changes and grows throughout the year. Capture all those precious moments with this sweet 13 opening frame. The main title of “My First Year ” is placed prominently at the top. Small round photo openings, with titles from birth to eleven months, surround a central rectangular photo opening. The words; “Look who’s one” is the focal point beneath the main photo. The front of the frame is finished in matte silver and complemented by beaded borders in a shiny silver finish. The black velvet rear panel removes easily for loading pictures. Perfect as a baby shower gift or as nursery decor. Create a lovely array of treasured memories with Malden International Designs Baby picture frame. Measurements are 8.85 inches (W) x 10.94 inches (H) x .39 inches (D).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OMp3tm3VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Malden","source_asin":"B011PLQPP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011PLQPP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011PLQPP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
