window.products.push({"id":1003786,"name":"XXXFLOWER Hat Rack for Wall Baseball Cap Organizer, Wall-Mounted Wooden Hat Hanger with 12 Hooks, Over The Door Hat Racks with 7 Hooks, Hat Holder Cap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i2YZNvmXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Space Saver: XXXFLOWER hat rack include 12 S-shaped hooks and 7 hooks in the door hat racks, which is enable you to hold up more than 19 hats. Besides, the 16-inch wooden shelf can be placed sunglasses, sunscreen, perfume and other items you need. The product will be a great helper to make your room tidy and organized. ✅Durable & Solid Material: Our hat holder is made of thicken pinewood, installed with baking painted iron rod and 12 iron s-shaped hooks are sturdy and stable for hanging different items. The \"S\" hooks are all removable so that you can adjust the quantity to suit your needs. The over-the-door cap holders with 7 hooks can adjust the strip length to fit door height. ✅Multi-Functional Usage: The wall hat racks can fit for various using purpose, it could be a hat organizer to fit for all types of hats storage, a closet organizer, a cooking gadget racks, a bag storage rack, a entryway clothes rack for hanging keys, coats, scarfs and so on. It's suitable for bedroom, entry-room, kitchen, living room, laundry room and office for fulfill your storage needs. ✅Ideal Gift Choices: The great capability of hat storage make it become a unique giftable solution for whom have many hats --- to help them get their hats organized, will be a definitely a great gift to your parents, friends, grandparents on Christmas, birthday, Thanksgiving Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, New Year and etc. ✅Package & Installation: The package include: 1*wooden shelf; 1*iron rod; 1*strip hat holder; 12 hooks; 3*expansion anchors; 8* tapping screws (Two sizes of screws). With these items and accessories, you could be easy to install and use the hat rack. The detail page also show the clear installation steps for your reference. Please feel free to let us know if you have any problem with the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i2YZNvmXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XXXFLOWER","source_asin":"B0B56CYSTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B56CYSTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B56CYSTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
