window.products.push({"id":1003859,"name":"Color Changing Christmas Icicle Lights Outdoor, 29.5Ft 360 LED Icicle String Lights Connectable with 60 Drops, 11 Modes White & Multicolor Fairy Twink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812rl1lx-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color Changing Christmas Lights Outdoor: Led icicle lights outdoor use the latest technology, compared with other ordinary single color lights string, our string lights can switch freely between White and Multi-color, meet your different needs. 29.5ft string lighted length + 16.4ft lead length, can easy to decorate your home, garden, party, wedding, tree, etc. End to end connectable, connect up to 3 sets(Total:88.5ft) 11 Modes & Remote Control: Our fairy twinkle lights have 11 different modes: mode 2- mode 11 cycling, white steady on, multicolor steady on, 30%white & 70% multicolor steady on, 70%white & 30% multicolor steady on, white & multicolor slo-glo, white & multicolor fade, white flash 5s slowly & 12s fastly, multicolor flash 5s slowly & 12s fastly, white & multicolor 5s slowly & 12s fastly, whtie & multicolor in waves. Use the remote control or press the button on the control box to change the mode Timer & Memory Function: Christmas icicle lights have 3 timer functions(6hrs on, 18hrs off; 18hrs on, 6hrs off; 6hrs on, 6hrs off, 3hrs on, 9hrs off), you can adjust and switch freely according to your own needs to save energy and money. Our led icicle lights also have memory function, Buit-in memory chip saves your last modes setting and no need to reset mode every time 4 Level Dimming & Waterproof: Adjustable 4 level brightness, create suitable, comfortable atmospheres at your needs according to various occasions. Color chaning string lights is IP44 waterproof, can withstand all kinds of weather and suitable for indoor and outdoor decoration( The power adapter is not waterproof, should keep it dry when used outdoor) Widely Application & Quality Service: This led window curtain lights would be the perfect for Christmas decorations, holiday, wedding, yard, patio, home, garden, etc. 30 days refund guarantee makes your purchase totally at free risk. Contact us anytime if any questions via Amazon email box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812rl1lx-xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jnaurb","source_asin":"B0BRJ5W3P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRJ5W3P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRJ5W3P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
