window.products.push({"id":1003904,"name":"WAFE Mini Oven Gloves 2PCS - Silicone Heat Resistant Pinch Mitts - UK Brand - Hands Protector & Fingers Grip Pot Holder for Kitchen Cooking Baking - U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JCXdodJlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sick of getting your fingers singed while baking, cooking or handling hot plates? Although making baked goods, grilled meats, stir fry vegetables and other culinary specialties is a lot of fun, the activity is not easy. You're always at risk of hurting yourself because of your constant exposure to incredibly hot stoves, grills, ovens and cooking tools. Great news is, you don’t have to worry about burning your skin when cooking ever again. All you need to do is get a pair of heat proof gloves which are strong against heat and regular use! Prepare and serve delectable meals safely by using the WAFE Mini-Oven Glove. Cook your family’s favourite baked chicken, steamed fish, mixed vegetables, savory pies and other home staples burn blister-free by wearing our mini-oven gloves. Made with a non-slip and textured grip, this kitchen accessory lets you handle pots and trays with ease–even when they’re piping hot! Another thing you’ll love about these potholders is the sleek and compact build. They’ll barely take up space in your drawers! Plus, they’re designed with a hanger hole for convenient storage. Need to find a useful but awesome present for a loved one who’s fond of preparing meals? Get them a pair of these mini-oven gloves and oven rack shield. The kitchen duo makes a fantastic choice for birthdays, thanksgiving, and Christmas. Need more reasons to get this protective cooking accessory? Check out these awesome benefits: ✅ Can be used for the microwave and toasters ✅ Great value for money–you get a bonus oven rack guard ✅ Perfect gift idea for budding cooks and pastry bakers Make meal preps safer and more enjoyable. Add the WAFE Mini-Oven Glove to your basket TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JCXdodJlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAFE","source_asin":"B09NY4CZDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1003904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NY4CZDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NY4CZDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
